     "extraction_status": "extracted",
     "value": "Subjects were presented with highly arousing and aversive pictures while using cognitive reappraisal to increase, maintain, or decrease their emotional responses. Each trial started with a 2 s instruction screen, followed by an 8 s picture presentation, a 4 s rating of the current emotional state, and a jittered fixation phase of 4\u20138 s. One experimental run consisted of 28 trials, with 7 trials per condition; each session consisted of six runs.",
